<title>SINGAPORE: Gul Tech set up manufacturing in China.</title>
<headline>Gul Tech set up manufacturing in China.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gul Technologies Singapore Ltd said on Friday it will set up a manufacturing plant in China's Suzhou Industrial Park.</p>
<p>&quot;The plant in China is a strategic move to expand into a one-stop solution centre providing both standard and high end printed circuit boards to customers,&quot; Jerry Rodrigues, GulTech president and chief executive officer said in the statement.</p>
<p>GulTech said it would pay US$3 million for the land in the industrial park.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
